{"unit_id":"leonardwwq__dsh-cultivation#feature-1","repo":"leonardwwq/dsh-cultivation","commit":"a60564b283ecfa8a1bc191012f4f14d8169edd4f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cultivation 的功能「会话角色绑定」：为新会话选择或创建角色，并在该会话保持绑定；开始对话后可开关角色，不能直接更换。入口位于输入框工具行和会话页角色控件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:856-885","lib/client.js:888-903"]}
{"unit_id":"leonardwwq__dsh-cultivation#feature-2","repo":"leonardwwq/dsh-cultivation","commit":"a60564b283ecfa8a1bc191012f4f14d8169edd4f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cultivation 的功能「角色记忆与成长」：插件整理角色记忆、关系、事件和对用户的认识，并渲染为角色上下文供后续回复使用；记忆按分区和容量管理。后台维护由默认模型生成提议。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.js:337-410","lib/core.js:1288-1325","lib/index.js:321-342"]}
{"unit_id":"leonardwwq__dsh-cultivation#feature-3","repo":"leonardwwq/dsh-cultivation","commit":"a60564b283ecfa8a1bc191012f4f14d8169edd4f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cultivation 的功能「本地角色库管理」：设置界面提供角色模板创建、编辑、设默认、删除、导入和导出，并显示亲密度；角色数据保存在 DSH_HOME 或 HOME 下的本地目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:800-848","lib/index.js:136-149"]}
{"unit_id":"leonardwwq__dsh-cultivation#feature-4","repo":"leonardwwq/dsh-cultivation","commit":"a60564b283ecfa8a1bc191012f4f14d8169edd4f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cultivation 的功能「外部 NPC 状态接口」：宿主可调用 cultivation 服务创建独立 NPC 状态，并处理事件以推进其记忆、关系和成长状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-6","lib/core.js:1288-1325"]}
